		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Skinless cloud giants with one milky Cyclopean eye. Feed on diseased mortals. Become active when shooting stars cross the sky.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14 (leather), <strong>HP</strong> 36, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 greatclub +9 (2d6) and suck essence, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Suck Essence</strong>. Suck the life force out of diseased mortal within double near, who must immediately roll a disease check. If disease gets worse, papinjuwari regains 4d6 HP.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
